{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"採訪日誌｜政府改革措施記者會／立法會委員會討論藍田站事故\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/REPORTER-DIARY-261030.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】政府今日(10月30日)舉行兩場改革措施記者會，分別為改革樓宇維修監管制度，以及打擊圍標措施。同日，立法會鐵路事宜小組委員會開會，討論藍田站兩宗事故。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:00:47.287794+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:22:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:20:04.601196+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:58:32.907898+00:00","content_hash":"0ad658a28321cc8429ac07951addbbe6feb9a781ced9aa637bca7c8c7f7a34b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:00:47.287794+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}